# Backend Ignore Rationale:
# CVE-2025-47273, GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964: These vulnerabilities exist in setuptools and msgpack
# inside the base python:3.13-alpine image at /usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages.
# Our application runs from a completely isolated virtual environment (/app/.venv)
# built by `uv` and we do not use the globally installed pip/setuptools in production.
